      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mountain_City%2C_Nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "After a copper discovery in 1879, the town experienced a second boom that lasted until the ore was exhausted, and again in the 1930s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
